# Salt or sugar on ice: equal masses are not equal particle counts
# Salt dissociates; sugar stays molecular. This equilibrium comparison does not
# model grain size, mixing speed or how quickly a real ice bath melts.
register lv2
add v1 water 100mL @ 0C
add v1 NaCl 20g
measure v1 thermometer
look v1
new beaker
add v2 water 100mL @ 0C
add v2 sucrose 20g
measure v2 thermometer
look v2
